# Skills installed in ~/.claude/skills/ that this repo deliberately does NOT author.
#
# install_skills.sh names anything installed-but-not-produced-here under
# "Installed but not produced here". Listing a name here says that is expected,
# and stops it being reported every run.
#
# This file is currently EMPTY on purpose. It was not always:
# debug-mantra, management-talk, post-mortem and scrutinize were listed here as
# third-party with no source. Their source was the sibling repo all along, and
# the merge that produced drunken-guild brought them in. They are first-party
# now, under skills/workflow/ and skills/leadership/.
#
# Add a name here only when a skill is genuinely authored elsewhere.
